NOTES = {
    # ---------------- Krnovsko (852)
    '822': "Krnov – Hošťálkovy, Staré Purkartice: one bus (83-2009), every 80 in the afternoon (Krnov 14:25, 15:45; Purkartice 14:55, 16:15), every 80 on the minute both ways (also Krnov 7:45, 11:45). The bus turns at the Purkartice loop in 0 min, so the run out is set to 29 min (as most of the day's trips) and one bus works it. Off the pattern: Krnov 17:25, 19:15; Purkartice 12:45, 17:55, 19:55 (the evening runs every 100–120 min).",
    '824': 'Krnov – Město Albrechtice – Heřmanovice – Vrbno, zámeček: one afternoon round (Krnov 12:05, Vrbno 14:18), every 480. Vrbno, Železná, rozcestí has no other line. The diversion timetable (to 12 Dec) runs.',
    '831': 'Krnov – Město Albrechtice – Dívčí Hrad – Osoblaha – Slezské Pavlovice every 4 h (Krnov 14:45; Pavlovice 12:17, 16:17), on the minute. The Bohušov and Povelice stops are on no other line.',
    '832': 'Krnov – Slezské Rudoltice – Rusín – Osoblaha at irregular times (Krnov 12:35, 16:20, 18:25; Osoblaha 12:51, 15:41). Every 180 on the real 16:20 and 15:41 with two buses; the shortest round would take one bus but leave every departure an hour off (owner check).',
    '833': "Krnov – Město Albrechtice – Jindřichov, station every 240 on the window's trips (Krnov 15:45; Jindřichov 17:20, also 9:20), one bus, the stop list via Město Albrechtice, rozcestí Dakon. The afternoon sends more buses out of Krnov (12:35, 14:25, 15:45, 18:05) than come back on 833 (17:20, 19:20): they go on to Osoblaha and 902 or end at Jindřichov, so the line runs at its return rate and the other Krnov departures are off the pattern (14:25 is the bus that runs 833 Osoblaha 15:39, 82-1005). Jindřichov – Vysoká – Osoblaha is 833 Osoblaha every 180 (Jindřichov 15:39, Osoblaha 16:44).",
    '901': 'Krnov – Heřmanovice – Zlaté Hory every 2 h (Krnov 17:15, also 9:15; Zlaté Hory :44 from 15:44 to 19:44): two buses. Modelled at 16:00: the busier 13:20–15:20 is the Město Albrechtice – Holčovice shorts (13:24, 13:59), whose stops are all on the line (as 282 on the Opavsko sheet). Off the pattern: Krnov 13:45, 15:05; Zlaté Hory 12:19. The diversion timetable (29 Sep – 19 Dec) runs.',
    '902': 'Jindřichov, station – Petrovice, U hájenky every 2 h (station :41, Petrovice :06; 11:41, 15:41, 17:46 and 12:06, 16:06, 18:06). The round on to Zlaté Hory (Jindřichov 13:21, Zlaté Hory 14:36, one bus, 82-2002) is 902 Zlaté Hory every 480 on that round; Petrovy Boudy, hřeben has no other line.',
    '913': 'Krnov – Horní Benešov – Šternberk – Olomouc: one return a day (Krnov 5:55, Olomouc 14:10). Every 480 with Olomouc 14:10 on the minute; the Krnov departure is set to 12:07 so one bus works it (owner check). Lipina, Horní Loděnice and Bílčice, bytovky have no other line.',
    # ---------------- Bruntálsko (853)
    '811': 'Krnov – Horní Benešov every 90, one bus: Krnov 15:05, Horní Benešov 14:20 and 15:50 (each Krnov departure comes back on the same bus about 75 min later, 83-1007 15:05 → 15:50), back via Lichnov, Dubnice, pohostinství as some trips run. Off the pattern: Krnov 13:00, 17:40, 19:45; Horní Benešov 12:45, 18:40. The Sosnová trips (Krnov 14:10, 15:40; Sosnová 14:40, 16:10) are 811 Sosnová every 90, on the minute.',
    '814': 'Krnov – Zátor – Čaková every 3 h on the 15:25 / 15:55 round (also 18:20 / 18:50, 4–5 min off), one bus; the bus turns at Čaková in 0 min, so Krnov is set 1 min early (15:24). The 13:40 / 14:15 round is off the pattern (its bus goes on to Zátor). The trip to Zátor, točna (Krnov 15:00) is 814 Zátor every 480 with an empty return; Zátor village stops have no other line.',
    '816': 'Krnov, station – Krasov every 3 h on the 15:10 round (Krasov 15:45, 83-1008), one bus. The other rounds (11:55, 13:50, 17:45 out; 12:30, 19:00 back) are off the pattern.',
    '817': 'Krnov – Úvalno – Býkov – Krnov loop every 1–1½ h until 16:30 (14:00, 15:05, 16:30): one bus every 90.',
    '818': 'Krnov – Brumovice, Úblo every 240 on the trips of the bus that sleeps at Úblo (83-2006: Úblo 15:03, Krnov 17:40), one bus. Krnov 15:10 is off the pattern: its bus (82-2006) works the Skrochovice shuttle and goes back at 17:40; Úblo 17:40 and 19:40 are off too. The Úblo – Skrochovice shuttle is 818 Skrochovice every 240 on its two afternoon rounds (Úblo 14:30, 15:40; Skrochovice 14:50, 16:00; also 11:40 / 12:00). The school trips Úblo – Neplachovice (12:30, 13:30; back 13:05, 14:10) are 818 Neplachovice every 480; they pass Skrochovice, most, but are not counted on the shuttle.',
    '819': "Krnov – Bruntál about hourly at irregular minutes: every 160 with two slots each way on the real minutes (Krnov 14:35, 16:00, also 10:40, 17:15; Bruntál 14:20, 15:40, also 5:00, 22:20), two buses. Off the pattern in the afternoon: Krnov 12:00, 12:40, 14:25 (83-2004's one round); Bruntál 12:00, 13:20, 14:40, 16:50, 18:40. Three slots each way would catch 14:25 and 14:40 too, for four buses (owner check).",
    '861': "Bruntál, station – Vrbno – Karlova Studánka – Vrbno, zámeček about hourly: every 160 on the window's real minutes (Bruntál 15:40, 16:40; zámeček 15:44, 16:54, also 14:14, 22:14), three buses. Keeping Bruntál hourly at :40 (every 120) costs a fourth bus (owner check). Off the pattern: Bruntál 12:30, 14:30, 17:45, 19:40; zámeček 12:09, 14:49, 19:09. The diversion timetable (12 Oct – 20 Dec) runs.",
    '862': 'Bruntál, station – Malá Morávka – Karlova Studánka, dolní parkoviště: every 240 on the two afternoon rounds (Bruntál 15:15, 16:05; Karlova Studánka 16:05, 17:15; also 12:05 both ways), two buses (83-2011 15:15 → 16:05, 84-1006 16:05 → 17:15). One bus every 120 (Bruntál 16:05, Karlova Studánka 17:15) would leave the 15:15 round off. Off the pattern: Bruntál 18:20, 19:10; Karlova Studánka 12:40, 15:10, 19:15.',
    '863': "Bruntál, bus station – Široká Niva – Vrbno, rozcestí Ludvíkov every 120 on 84-1009's round (Bruntál 14:20 → Ludvíkov 15:10, back 16:15; Ludvíkov also 14:15, 18:15, 22:15), two buses. Off the pattern: Bruntál 12:45, 15:00, 16:25, 18:25; Ludvíkov 12:35, 14:40. Both window rounds (Bruntál 14:20, 15:00; Ludvíkov 14:15, 14:40) need four buses (owner check). The trips to Karlova Studánka, Hvězda have no line of their own: their stops are on 861, 862 and 885.",
    '865': 'Bruntál, station – Dětřichovice: one afternoon round (Bruntál 15:05 → Dětřichovice, 15:37 → Světlá Hora, bus station), back to Bruntál empty; every 480. Dětřichovice has no other line.',
    '866': 'Světlá Hora local: bus station – Stará Voda – Suchá Rudná – Podlesí at 13:40, 14:20 and 15:50, back 13:54 and 14:35 (on to Bruntál). Every 480 with all five trips; two buses, as the 15:50 is the 865 bus. Suchá Rudná and Podlesí have no other line.',
    '872': 'Bruntál – Milotice nad Opavou: two afternoon rounds with one bus (Bruntál 13:50, 15:15; Milotice 14:10, 15:35), every 480 on both. The way back is counted at Bruntál, station, where the 14:10 ends.',
    '874': 'Horní Benešov – Svobodné Heřmanice – Horní Životice every 3 h (Horní Benešov 15:10, Životice 15:44). The Heřmanice short trips have no line of their own: their stops are on 874.',
    '885': 'Bruntál, station – Malá Morávka, Ovčárna (Praděd) every 2 h, on the minute (Bruntál 14:40, 16:40; Ovčárna 13:30, 15:30, 17:30).',
    '907': 'Vrbno, station – Vidly – Zlaté Hory: three afternoon rounds (Vrbno 12:50, 15:15, 17:30; Zlaté Hory 14:25, 16:30, 18:20), every 480 on all six with one bus (also Zlaté Hory 6:25). The diversion timetable (29 Sep – 19 Dec) runs.',
    # ---------------- Rýmařovsko (854)
    '873': 'Bruntál, station – Václavov: two afternoon rounds (13:38 / 14:05; 12:35 to Václavov, střed); every 240 on the minute. Václavov has no other line.',
    '877': 'Rýmařov – Břidličná – Bruntál, station, modelled at 16:00: the busier 14:00–16:00 is the KARLA trip and a Kovohutě – Rýmařov short, whose stops are on the line. Every 120, Rýmařov 15:40 (also 17:40) and Bruntál 16:20 (also 18:20, 20:20), two buses. Rýmařov sends more buses out (13:20, 14:00, 14:40, 15:40, 16:40) than 877 brings back (13:20, 15:40, 16:20): they return on 920 (Opavsko sheet) and 877 KARLA, so the other Rýmařov departures and Bruntál 15:40 are off the pattern. Rýmařov hourly at :40 costs a third bus (owner check). The trips to and from Bruntál, KARLA (Rýmařov 12:40, KARLA 14:17, also 4:40/6:17 and 20:40/22:17) are 877 KARLA every 480, on the minute, and are not counted on 877.',
    '878': 'Rýmařov – Malá Morávka, Karlov: two rounds in the afternoon with one bus (Rýmařov 14:10, 15:30; Karlov 14:55, 16:10), every 480 on all four (the morning 6:00 / 6:45 is 10 min off).',
    '879': 'Rýmařov – Dolní Moravice, Nová Ves: three rounds a day (Rýmařov 6:45, 12:00, 13:50); every 240 on 13:50 / 14:20. Nová Ves has no other line.',
    '880': 'Rýmařov – Stará Ves, Anenská Huť: three back-to-back rounds in the afternoon (Rýmařov 14:25, 15:15, 16:00; Anenská Huť 14:45, 15:35, 16:15), every 180 on all of them with one bus (also Anenská Huť 6:35, 7:15). The bus turns at Anenská Huť in 0 min after the 16:00, so that departure is set at 15:59. Off the pattern: 12:50 / 13:05. The diversion timetable (20 Jul – 14 Dec) runs.',
    '909': 'Bruntál, station – Razová – Bílčice – Moravský Beroun, náměstí about every 2 h (Bruntál 12:50, 14:45; Beroun 13:30, 15:10, 17:15): every 120 on 14:45 and 15:10, two buses. The short trips to Leskovec, rozcestí Bohdanovice (Bruntál 12:25, 15:10, 18:35; back 12:50, 19:05) are 909 Leskovec every 180 (one bus).',
    '910': 'Bruntál, station – Roudno – Dvorce – Moravský Beroun, station every 2 h (Bruntál 12:45, 16:45; Beroun 14:25, 16:25), timed so the bus passes Moravský Beroun, náměstí on time.',
    '911': 'Bruntál, station – Dětřichov – Moravský Beroun, Granitol every 4 h, on the minute (Bruntál 12:58, 16:58; Granitol 14:15, 18:15).',
    '912': 'Rýmařov – Jiříkov, Sovinec – Šternberk every 4 h (Rýmařov 13:40, Šternberk 15:25). The diversion timetable (15 – 21 Oct) ends the next day, so the regular one is modelled.',
    '921': 'Rýmařov – Břidličná – Huzová – Šternberk – Olomouc: two returns a day, every 480 on the afternoon pair (Rýmařov 12:25, Olomouc 16:55; 8:55 fits too). The Břidličná – Huzová – Ryžoviště local trips have no line of their own. Regular timetable (the diversion ends 23 Oct).',
    '922': 'Rýmařov, station – bus station – Tvrdkov, Ruda: three afternoon rounds (bus station 13:55, 15:50, 17:25; Ruda 14:20, 16:20, 17:50), every 480 on all six with one bus, timed so the bus passes the bus station on time (station 13:50, 15:45, 17:20). The Uničov trips pass Ruda but belong to 922 Uničov (Rýmařov 12:30, also 4:30 and 20:30; Uničov 15:09), every 480; the Uničov region stops have no other line.',
    # ---------------- MHD Krnov (856)
    '801': 'Nemocnice, hlavní brána – bus stand – Petrův důl every 30 at :05 / :35 at both ends (the real minutes 8:35–12:05 and 14:35–15:35), two buses. At the shift changes (12:48–16:05, 4:49–6:30) trips run on from Petrův důl to the industrial zone II: that is 801 PZ, a Petrův důl – průmyslová zóna II shuttle every 480 at their times there (13:05, 13:30, 14:05, 14:34, 15:22, 15:52; back 13:15–16:06 at the točna), so the trunk is not doubled (owner check). The zone trips come back past Petrův důl at 13:46, 14:20 and 14:47, off the :05 / :35, so the way back is approximate in 13:40–15:40; every 120 with five slots each way would be exact there, for four buses (owner check).',
    '802': 'Bus stand – Ježník, sanatorium: three 45-min rounds in the afternoon (bus stand 13:10, 13:55, 14:55; back 13:30, 14:15, 15:19), every 160 on all six with one bus (also 16:35 / 16:55, 1 and 0 min off).',
    '805': 'Hlubčická, Na špici – Chomýž, točna: one bus alternating in the afternoon (Hlubčická 13:25, 14:40, 16:10; Chomýž 14:03, 15:35, with the 10:30 as the third), every 480 on all six.',
    '806': 'Bus stand – Cvilín: two afternoon rounds (bus stand 14:45, 16:00; Cvilín 15:05, 16:20), every 480 on both, one bus. The trip via the state border (bus stand 17:50 → st. hranice CLO, 18:04 → Cvilín) is 806 CLO every 480; those stops have no other line.',
    '807': 'Nemocnice – Guntramovice – bus stand: one afternoon trip (14:13, back 14:33), every 480. Guntramovice has no other line.',
    # ---------------- MHD Bruntál (855)
    '851': 'Bruntál town: station – nový hřbitov – KARLA (12:50, 16:40) and KARLA – station (14:12, 17:27), every 480 on both pairs with one bus (also KARLA 22:12). The second loop, 852, has no line of its own: its stops are on 851 and the regional lines.',
}
